      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I successfully completed the age verification process by submitting my ID, but when attempting the face verification step, which required me to move my face from left to right, I encountered persistent errors. Despite trying various approaches to resolve the issue, the system continued to fail at recognizing my movements, ultimately leading to the process being canceled. As a result, I had no choice but to contact support, where I submitted a ticket requesting the reset of the verification link to continue the process. This is the link used...\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_429dae44-8af3-45a5-b5d9-ae674d97a22c/ageverification/078a740",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
