  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I’ve tried the age verification process but somehow the system has difficulties identifying scanned images. After many tries, I’ve got locked out and I had to contact support, that may or may not answer (I’m still waiting). In Roblox, which also uses Persona, I didn’t have any problem.\n\nWhy can’t I see my birthday on my VRchat profile? This would be important to see if there are any problems that need to be corrected. This is a requirement under Art. 5 letter d GDPR: Information must be accurate if that is not the case, it has to be corrected.",
